(7546491, 1208342, 114285, '<td valign="top">I wonder how you did this with standard editing, anyway it''s a good idea,  just a little clumsily put together. The coffee beans in the foreground are out of focus, and the corrugated or striped background is not pleasing to the eyes, a plain background would''ve suited this image. Having said that I commend you trying.</td>', 'I wonder how you did this with standard editing, anyway it''s a good idea,  just a little clumsily put together. The coffee beans in the foreground are out of focus, and the corrugated or striped background is not pleasing to the eyes, a plain background would''ve suited this image. Having said that I commend you trying.', '2017-11-28 19:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
